  "description": "About the team: At Meesho, we believe in putting the user first and solving problems for the next billion users in India. VaLMo is Meesho\u2019s own logistic arm, established to provide cutting edge logistic and supply chain support. This role is for someone who is ready to execute at light speed and has a growth mindset to build and scale our supply chain and logistics models. We're looking for an exceptional talent who is passionate about leveraging data and advanced research to create a world-class e-commerce experience. Supply Chain Network Optimization is an integral part of the VaLMo Data Science team that operates at the heart of VaLMo's vision, developing innovative, data-driven solutions that directly impact millions of users. We're not just solving today's problems; we're thinking long term to build models and frameworks that will define the future of our business. This team uses a wide variety of engineering and advanced applied mathematical techniques (OR, ML, DL, MILP etc) techniques to study and solve niche problems in supply chain across the entire value chain (network design, first/last mile optimization)",
